1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,810
This lesson: how escrow protects you.

2
00:00:04,410 --> 00:00:09,630
After you pay, a third party holds the funds, not the expert.

3
00:00:10,230 --> 00:00:14,100
The money is released only when you accept the delivery.

4
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:19,630
If there is a dispute, every message and delivery is on record.

5
00:00:20,230 --> 00:00:23,800
So at every step, you know where the money is.

